IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P3-section-3`
IMPORT `P3-art-18`
IMPORT `P3-art-19`

-- Tests of Articles 18 and 19. Expected values are written from the text before the run.
-- Art 18(1): the period ends 10 years after placing on the market; the system here is placed on 2 December 2027, so the last day is 2 December 2037 (taken as inside the period).
-- Art 19(1): at least six months; the boundary is 6 months against 5.

§ `Fixtures`

`P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 12 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 12 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027 and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

`P3 system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 plain circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 Section B circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS TRUE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 equivalent protection circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS TRUE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS TRUE


-- Art 18(1)(a) to (e), positional: (a), (b), changes approved by notified bodies exist, (c), decisions of notified bodies exist, (d), (e).
`P3 documents all kept` MEANS `Art 18(1) what is kept at the disposal of the national competent authorities` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 documents where applicable only` MEANS `Art 18(1) what is kept at the disposal of the national competent authorities` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`P3 documents changes exist but not kept` MEANS `Art 18(1) what is kept at the disposal of the national competent authorities` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`P3 documents decisions exist but not kept` MEANS `Art 18(1) what is kept at the disposal of the national competent authorities` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE
`P3 documents without (a)` MEANS `Art 18(1) what is kept at the disposal of the national competent authorities` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`P3 documents without (b)` MEANS `Art 18(1) what is kept at the disposal of the national competent authorities` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`P3 documents without (e)` MEANS `Art 18(1) what is kept at the disposal of the national competent authorities` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE


§ `Art 18(1): the last day of the period and whether it runs on the date asked`

#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the last day of the period for keeping the documentation` `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` EQUALS Date 2 12 2037
-- An anniversary that does not exist is clamped: placed on 29 February 2028, the tenth anniversary is 28 February 2038 (2038 is no leap year).
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the last day of the period for keeping the documentation` (`AI system` OF Date 29 2 2028, `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`, FALSE) EQUALS Date 28 2 2038
-- On the placement day, on the last day, the day after, and the day before the placement.
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the period for keeping the documentation runs on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the period for keeping the documentation runs on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2037) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the period for keeping the documentation runs on the date asked` (Date 3 12 2037) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Asked before the system is placed (placed 2 December 2028; the group applies from 2 December 2027): the text names no start.
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the period for keeping the documentation runs on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Before the group applies: not covered. Art 2(13): the Article may be limited for an Article 6(1) system with equivalent protection: not covered.
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the period for keeping the documentation runs on the date asked` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the period for keeping the documentation runs on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the period for keeping the documentation runs on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Art 18(1)(a) to (e): the documents kept, where applicable`

#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the documents listed in points (a) to (e) are kept` `P3 documents all kept`
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the documents listed in points (a) to (e) are kept` `P3 documents where applicable only`
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 18(1) the documents listed in points (a) to (e) are kept` `P3 documents changes exist but not kept`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 18(1) the documents listed in points (a) to (e) are kept` `P3 documents decisions exist but not kept`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 18(1) the documents listed in points (a) to (e) are kept` `P3 documents without (a)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 18(1) the documents listed in points (a) to (e) are kept` `P3 documents without (b)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 18(1) the documents listed in points (a) to (e) are kept` `P3 documents without (e)`)

§ `Art 18(1): the provider keeps the documents at the disposal of the national competent authorities`

#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the provider keeps the documents at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 documents all kept` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the provider keeps the documents at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2037) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 documents where applicable only` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the provider keeps the documents at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 documents changes exist but not kept` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the provider keeps the documents at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 documents without (a)` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- After the period: JUST FALSE (the periods ruling of 2026-11-05, rule (a); fork F-18-1). Before the placement: NOTHING (the text gives no start).
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was #ASSERT `Art 18(1) the provider keeps the documents at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 3 12 2037) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 documents all kept` EQUALS NOTHING; the period is one the text fixes in its own words ("a period ending 10 years after"), so outside it the periods ruling of 2026-11-05, rule (a) (ENCODING-GUIDE.md line 93: "outside the period the answer is `JUST FALSE`"), gives JUST FALSE; before the placement the answer stays NOTHING (the text gives the period no start)
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the provider keeps the documents at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 3 12 2037) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 documents all kept` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the provider keeps the documents at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 documents all kept` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the provider keeps the documents at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 documents all kept` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 18(1) the provider keeps the documents at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` `P3 documents all kept` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Art 18(2): conditions for a provider or its authorised representative that goes bankrupt or ceases its activity`

-- args: established on the Member State's territory; goes bankrupt or ceases its activity; the date it did so
#ASSERT `Art 18(2) the Member State is to determine the conditions under which the documentation remains at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE (Date 1 6 2030) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 18(2) the Member State is to determine the conditions under which the documentation remains at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE (Date 2 12 2037) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 18(2) the Member State is to determine the conditions under which the documentation remains at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE (Date 3 12 2037) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 18(2) the Member State is to determine the conditions under which the documentation remains at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE (Date 1 6 2030) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 18(2) the Member State is to determine the conditions under which the documentation remains at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 6 2030) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 18(2) the Member State is to determine the conditions under which the documentation remains at the disposal of the national competent authorities` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE (Date 1 6 2030) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 18(3): a financial institution maintains the technical documentation under financial services law`

-- args: the provider is such a financial institution; the technical documentation is maintained as part of the documentation kept under that law
#ASSERT `Art 18(3) the provider that is a financial institution has maintained the technical documentation as part of the documentation kept under financial services law` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 18(3) the provider that is a financial institution has maintained the technical documentation as part of the documentation kept under financial services law` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 18(3) the provider that is a financial institution has maintained the technical documentation as part of the documentation kept under financial services law` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 18(3) the provider that is a financial institution has maintained the technical documentation as part of the documentation kept under financial services law` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 18(3) the provider that is a financial institution has maintained the technical documentation as part of the documentation kept under financial services law` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 19(1): the logs, for at least six months`

-- args: under the provider's control; the provider keeps them; the period is appropriate to the intended purpose; the number of months kept; other law provides otherwise
#ASSERT `Art 19(1) the provider keeps the logs referred to in Article 12(1) for an appropriate period of at least six months` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE 6 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 19(1) the provider keeps the logs referred to in Article 12(1) for an appropriate period of at least six months` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE 7 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 19(1) the provider keeps the logs referred to in Article 12(1) for an appropriate period of at least six months` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE 5 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 19(1) the provider keeps the logs referred to in Article 12(1) for an appropriate period of at least six months` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE 12 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 19(1) the provider keeps the logs referred to in Article 12(1) for an appropriate period of at least six months` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE 12 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not under its control: "to the extent such logs are under their control" limits the duty (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `Art 19(1) the provider keeps the logs referred to in Article 12(1) for an appropriate period of at least six months` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE TRUE 0 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Other Union or national law provides otherwise: the period is that law's (points outside the text), however few months the logs are kept; but a log not kept at all is still a "no".
#ASSERT `Art 19(1) the provider keeps the logs referred to in Article 12(1) for an appropriate period of at least six months` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE 3 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 19(1) the provider keeps the logs referred to in Article 12(1) for an appropriate period of at least six months` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE 0 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 19(1) the provider keeps the logs referred to in Article 12(1) for an appropriate period of at least six months` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE 6 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 19(1) the provider keeps the logs referred to in Article 12(1) for an appropriate period of at least six months` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE 6 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 19(2): a financial institution maintains the logs under financial services law`

#ASSERT `Art 19(2) the provider that is a financial institution has maintained the logs as part of the documentation kept under financial services law` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 19(2) the provider that is a financial institution has maintained the logs as part of the documentation kept under financial services law` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 19(2) the provider that is a financial institution has maintained the logs as part of the documentation kept under financial services law` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 19(2) the provider that is a financial institution has maintained the logs as part of the documentation kept under financial services law` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Traces: Article 18(1) and Article 19(1), prohibitions on ceasing to keep during the stated period; the other duties have no time limit`

-- Placed 2 December 2027, asked 2 December 2027: the last day of the period, 2 December 2037, is day 3653 (ten years, with 29 February in 2028, 2032 and 2036).
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 18(1) the provider's duty to keep the documentation at the disposal of the national competent authorities for the period` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 18(1) cease to keep at the disposal of the national competent authorities the documentation listed in points (a) to (e)` AT 100
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 18(1) the provider's duty to keep the documentation at the disposal of the national competent authorities for the period` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 18(1) cease to keep at the disposal of the national competent authorities the documentation listed in points (a) to (e)` AT 3653
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 18(1) the provider's duty to keep the documentation at the disposal of the national competent authorities for the period` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 18(1) cease to keep at the disposal of the national competent authorities the documentation listed in points (a) to (e)` AT 3654
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 18(1) the provider's duty to keep the documentation at the disposal of the national competent authorities for the period` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 4000
-- Before the group applies, or cut off by Art 2(2): nothing is owed, so ceasing is no breach.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 18(1) the provider's duty to keep the documentation at the disposal of the national competent authorities for the period` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 18(1) cease to keep at the disposal of the national competent authorities the documentation listed in points (a) to (e)` AT 100
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 18(1) the provider's duty to keep the documentation at the disposal of the national competent authorities for the period` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 18(1) cease to keep at the disposal of the national competent authorities the documentation listed in points (a) to (e)` AT 100
-- The Member State "shall determine conditions": no time limit, no consequence stated.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 18(2) the Member State's duty to determine the conditions` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 18(2) Member State` DOES `Art 18(2) determine the conditions under which the documentation remains at the disposal of the national competent authorities` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 18(2) the Member State's duty to determine the conditions` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 18(3) the provider's duty to maintain the technical documentation as part of the documentation kept under financial services law` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 18(3) maintain the technical documentation as part of the documentation kept under the relevant Union financial services law` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 18(3) the provider's duty to maintain the technical documentation as part of the documentation kept under financial services law` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- Art 19(1): six months from 2 December 2027 is 2 June 2028, day 183 (31 + 31 + 29 + 31 + 30 + 31 days); ceasing to keep the log on that day or earlier breaches.
-- EXPECT BREACH
