    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 19(1) cease to keep the logs referred to in Article 12(1)` AT 100
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 19(1) the provider's duty to keep the logs for at least six months` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
